codex_title = "Lantern moths"
codex_text = "Moths that roost in a hollow trunk and see in the green dark under the crowns, where our optics see nothing past a few metres. They gather in thousands round something pale in the north-west grove. Their eyes filter the canopy's light: a lens cut the same way would let a sensor see much further in the understory."
